TI  - Heterogeneity of Rift Valley fever virus transmission potential across livestock hosts, quantified through a model-based analysis of host viral load and vector infection
AU  - Cecilia, Hélène
AU  - Vriens, Roosmarie
AU  - Wichgers Schreur, Paul J.
AU  - De Wit, Mariken M.
AU  - Métras, Raphaëlle
