TI  - A note on the global properties of an age-structured viral dynamic model with multiple target cell populations
AU  - Wang, Shaoli
AU  - Wu, Jianhong
AU  - Rong, Libin
AU  - 1. School of Mathematics and Statistics, Henan University, Kaifeng 475001, Henan, China
